y mouth and  my throat in plain English I've got a  second stomach anything I swallow  disappears into a pocket Dimension made  of anomalously elastic intestinal tissue  where it's stored until I need it again  if there's a limit to how much I can  store in there I haven't found it yet  the amount of stuff in there has no  effect on my overall weight or my  ability to move once it's in there it's  just kind of gone until I want it back  on top of that my lower jaw can be  stretched up to six feet at two meters  for those of you we're those who use the  metric system in any direction so in the  addition to being a juggler and a clown  I also made the killing as a geek at  Hermann Fuller circus I don't mean geek  as in all the sign James T Kirk Funko  Pop that's still in mint condition I  mean the sense of somebody who gets paid  the weird junk as a form of performance  although I have been accused by some of  being both now you're probably thinking  Mota mouth my power my good body there's  so many couriers you could have gone  into with that very specific set of  skills garbage disposal one-man moving  man service left luggage abandoned at  Grand Central Station sky's the limit  man well sure but I love the circus  they're the only family I've ever got in  this world that came to them when I was  just a wildlife Punk kid of eight years  old and they took me in like I was their  own flesh and blood yeah believe it or  not I wasn't actually born into the  circus life a lot of circus and  Performing Arts folks are born into the  industry born in a costume trunk as they  say but unfortunately that's not me I  was born in New York City on April 10  1976. my dad had took off long before I  showed up leaving me in the care of my  dear old mom my special abilities  manifested early and my mom recognized  them right away you know how little kids  are always putting things in the mouths  right it's killed when it's a block or  an action figure but less so when it's  the entir